## 8. Overall Project Health
Overall Portfolio Status: At Risk
All four projects require continuous monitoring and coordination.
The Taxi Booking Website requires the highest attention because it has only 30% completion and 70% remaining work.
The Restaurant POS System needs stronger QA and integration coordination. The E-Commerce Platform requires better management of development dependencies, while the Employee Management System needs clear client acceptance criteria.
9. Day 1 Conclusion
The Day 1 project audit provides an initial understanding of the current condition of all four projects.
The audit identifies the major project concerns, establishes proposed RAG monitoring criteria, and highlights the information required from stakeholders.
The next step is to prepare the resource allocation and workload plan by assigning the available six developers and two QA engineers across the four projects.


